-- ============================================================================
-- NOTE: input_fields in execute_llm_prompt actions
-- ============================================================================
-- Many agents also use input_fields for execute_llm_prompt actions.
-- These are a DIFFERENT usage - they control which variables are available
-- in the LLM prompt template (for Go template rendering), not for agent calls.
-- These do NOT need to be converted to input_mapping.
--
-- Examples (NOT requiring conversion):
-- - site-planner: plan_site step uses input_fields for LLM template vars
-- - briefing-agent: infer_via_llm step uses input_fields for LLM template vars
-- - content-reviewer: auto_eval_content step uses input_fields for LLM template vars
-- - research-agent: synthesize step uses input_fields for LLM template vars
-- ============================================================================

